---
title: "G.A.N.E — Authentication & Authorization Flow"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User/Browser
    participant SPA as React SPA
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Auth as Auth Service
    participant OAuth as Manus OAuth
    participant DB as TiDB Database

    Note over U,DB: === OAuth 2.0 Login Flow ===

    U->>SPA: Click "Login"
    SPA->>SPA: getLoginUrl(returnPath)<br/>Encode origin + returnPath in state
    SPA->>OAuth: Redirect to VITE_OAUTH_PORTAL_URL<br/>with state parameter
    OAuth->>U: Show login form
    U->>OAuth: Enter credentials
    OAuth->>API: Redirect to /api/oauth/callback<br/>with authorization code + state
    API->>Auth: Exchange code for access token<br/>via OAUTH_SERVER_URL
    Auth->>OAuth: POST /token (code, client_id)
    OAuth-->>Auth: Access token + user profile
    Auth->>DB: Upsert user record<br/>(openId, name, avatar)
    DB-->>Auth: User record (with role)
    Auth->>Auth: Sign JWT session cookie<br/>(RS256, 24h TTL)
    Auth-->>API: Set-Cookie: session=JWT<br/>(HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite)
    API->>SPA: Redirect to origin + returnPath<br/>(from decoded state)
    SPA->>SPA: Cookie auto-attached

    Note over U,DB: === Authenticated API Call ===

    SPA->>API: tRPC request<br/>Cookie: session=JWT
    API->>Auth: Verify JWT signature<br/>Check expiry
    Auth-->>API: ctx.user = { id, role, openId }
    API->>API: protectedProcedure check<br/>Role-based access control

    alt Admin Operation
        API->>API: Check ctx.user.role === 'admin'
        alt Authorized
            API->>DB: Execute admin query
            DB-->>API: Result
            API-->>SPA: Success response
        else Forbidden
            API-->>SPA: 403 FORBIDDEN
        end
    else Regular Operation
        API->>DB: Execute query<br/>(row-level security)
        DB-->>API: User-scoped result
        API-->>SPA: Success response
    end

    Note over U,DB: === Session Expiry ===

    SPA->>API: tRPC request (expired JWT)
    API->>Auth: JWT verification fails
    Auth-->>API: UNAUTHORIZED (10001)
    API-->>SPA: Error: "Please login"
    SPA->>SPA: redirectToLoginIfUnauthorized()
    SPA->>OAuth: Redirect to login
